  "body": "## What's Changed\n\n- ui: focus the sidebar at startup by Bjarne Oeverli ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`731168a`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/731168a38ba72307fea93c424e0e6220d26c60c2))\n- logs: fix pager slowdown as the buffer fills by Bjarne Oeverli ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`fba79c1`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/fba79c13068abeb12c3ed33c6639cab7f8992012))\n- feat: add as, as-group and as-uid as available arguments (#39) by Carl Otto Strömstedt ([@carlottostromstedt](https://github.com/carlottostromstedt)) ([`fcfff89`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/fcfff895d5397a56824ed8a6df1ce2143b4ae65f))\n- plugins: add user-defined shortcuts from config.yaml (#42) by David Morcillo ([@beagleknight](https://github.com/beagleknight)) ([`73d3656`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/73d36564ec56436c4d1160f79688458db0db5dbb))\n- ui: sort text cells naturally so embedded numbers order by value (#41) by Ferran Basora ([@fcsonline](https://github.com/fcsonline)) ([`0586288`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/0586288d544bbd00aa260eb149c49da004844110))\n\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/compare/v0.11.0...v0.12.0\n\n## Checksums (SHA256)\n\n```\n3f096d6b15f1a6c146e3e9beab3e8a2f85960c9890c9b350ebcd8d829524a235  ku-darwin-amd64\ne63c000f84049f32429e9ea832f60172c3cd1702599c64bc51d7d85666e33e62  ku-darwin-arm64\n4899bd790f7681b90e425ecebfa09cc757307ca70e4e504079714470e50171ed  ku-linux-amd64\n00d6aea7ed6e66df0476d601532459b2be0f81c9023c29387a2513078e839f61  ku-linux-arm64\nc09676c7e3ea15f6904e042ac88376f202ecab61a4f1b8bd1304382e969c70f4  ku-windows-amd64.exe\nbad8e5b976b9e2e2e2dd163f4b3d63499593c9f17f519e43e6f22960a89c3152  ku-windows-arm64.exe\n```\n",
